  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The People and Planet Project is implemented in Ireland by Waterford Sustainable Living Ireland as part of a consortium in receipt of the European Union&#x2019;s Development Education and Awareness Raising (DEAR) Programme. The project aims to target young people in the non-formal sector with the goal of empowering youth citizen activists to take positive climate action. Key activities include street campaigns, sustainable events, workshops and a Youth Climate Council.</narrative>
  </description>
